There is **no** existing unit test for label layout: `rg -l "textMargin|minMargin|hideOverlap|labelLayout|shiftLayout" test/ut` returns nothing. The only related spec is `test/ut/spec/util/graphic.test.ts` (`describe('expandOrShrinkRect')`, lines 112-186), which covers the primitive used by the margin code — run it as a regression guard.

